#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To build an acoustic model, man annotated samples are required. Often these "
"will be recorded by many different teams and it can be hard to enforce "
"strict quality requirements given the large amount of data collected."
msgstr ""
"Da bi izgradili akustični model,rastavljeni zabilježeni uzorci su obavezni. "
"Često ovo će biti zabilježeno putem različitih timova i može biti teško "
"primijeniti zbog velikog broja podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmyapplication; provides a very simple interface to listen to recorded "
"samples and to blacklist samples that are of poor quality."
msgstr ""
"&kmyapplication; pruža vrlo jednostavno sučelje za slušanje snimljenih "
"uzoraka i na crnu listu uzorke koji su lošeg kvaliteta."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kmyapplication;"
msgstr "Korištenje &kmyapplication;"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Main window</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Glavni prozor</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Main window</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Glavni prozor</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The main window requests the path to the prompts file to review, the path "
"prefix to the audio samples and an output path for the produced blacklist "
"file. If this file already exists it will be loaded when starting the review."
msgstr ""
"Glavni prozor traži fajlove na upit za pregled, upit prefiks na audio uzorke "
"i outout za produkte crne liste. Ako ovo fajlovi već postoje pokrenut će se "
"kad počnete da pregledate."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Optionally, a Sam model build log of a model compilation process involving "
"the samples to be reviewed can be provided. &kmyapplication; will then try "
"to use intermediate results of the model compilation process to order the "
"review samples to most- to least-likely erroneous. This way, even very short "
"reviews can substantially improve the model generation process."
msgstr "Opcionalno,."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Review samples</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Uzorci pregleda</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Review samples</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Uzorci pregleda</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To navigate through the review process more quickly you can use keyboard "
"shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"Da bi prošli kroz proces pregleda brže možete koristiti kratice za tastaturu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
