#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "Go back to the previous sample."
msgstr "Vratite se na prethodni primjer."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To apply a blacklist to a prompts file, you can, for example, use the "
"<command>cleanprompts.sh</command> script bundled with Simon: "
"<command>cleanprompts.sh blacklist inputprompts outputprompts</command>"
msgstr ""
"Za primjenu crne liste na upit za datoteku, na primjer, koristite  "
"<command>cleanprompts.sh</command> script bundled with Simon: "
"<command>cleanprompts.sh blacklist inputprompts outputprompts</command>"

